  "prefLabel": "Bar 701.05 Renewal of a Mobile Barbershop",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bar 701.05 Renewal of a Mobile Barbershop. Each applicant wishing to renew their license shall:\n\n(a) Complete and submit a “Universal Application for License Renewal” as required by Plc 308.05(b)(1); and\n\n(b) Pay the shop license renewal application fee required by Plc 1002.07.\n\nSource. #13128, eff 10-30-20; ss by #14660, eff 10-15-26, EXPIRES: 10-15-36",
